      "description": "Primary Button from the implemented TripBuddy interface.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\">Join the adventure</button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font:650 .78rem Manrope,sans-serif;background:#254d3d;color:#fff;border:1px solid #254d3d;border-radius:4px;padding:15px 23px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,box-shadow .2s}.ds-primary:hover{background:#173b2c;box-shadow:0 5px 15px #243d3214}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ba713e;outline-offset:4px}.ds-primary:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}"
